WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.680
Now, everybody.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:26.770
We're at the midpoint...

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:29.150
...in the League Tournament of
the Gundam Fight Final Battle.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:32.610
The Fighters are desperate to chalk
up as many wins as they can.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.610
And today's scheduled
main event is...

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:41.320
Neo Denmark
Mermaid Gundam

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:37.970
Dragon Gundam versus...

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:39.740
...Mermaid Gundam of Neo Denmark.

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:41.320
However...

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.120
...in the midst of these Fights...

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.910
...Sai Saici is taken by
a young woman...

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:50.790
...who, with a twist of fate,
makes his heart leap...

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.710
...as if he'd met a real mermaid.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.300
And, now!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.430
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:06.470
Running Away!
Sai Saici in Love

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:15.900
That's Mermaid Gundam
from Neo Denmark.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.240
Our opponent in the
upcoming match.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.240
Let's study him the best that we can.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:21.740
Sai Saici...

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:24.950
...the Shaolin Temple can never
be revived unless you win.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.490
I know that.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:29.160
Oh, I didn't realize
you two were here.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.080
Well, Miss Rain!

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.170
Hey, Sis!

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.250
And...

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:35.920
...Bro's here?

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:39.340
I presume you're here to
check up on the enemy.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.590
No, I don't think it's
all that necessary.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:43.180
What do you mean?!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:47.350
Don't forget, I also act
as your strategic advisor.

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:48.810
Please calm down, you two.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.190
The match is in its final stage.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:52.190
Look there.

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:55.610
It's Matador Gundam's special
technique, the Red Flag Swirl.

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.360
It always amazes me.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.440
How will Mermaid counter?

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:08.700
A counterattack!

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:22.010
Got him...

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:41.070
He didn't make it to the
Finals on luck alone.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.650
He's got amazing agility.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.450
No. Don't get carried away.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.240
He's good at covering up the damage.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.080
But that Gundam is quite battered.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.290
It may last one more match,
but that's it.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.920
Then, in his next match
against Dragon Gundam...

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:59.550
...he'll be fighting Sai Saici
as if there's nothing to lose.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.550
Just a little more.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:04.880
Please hold up a little longer.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.470
Sai Saici, don't take him lightly...

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.560
Sai Saici?

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.190
So, I'm fighting Mermaid
Gundam or whoever...

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.110
...but they don't think
I'm going to lose, do they?

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.780
Boy, that looks good!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.110
One of these, please.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.150
What is this slop?!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.280
How dare you try to
feed this to us.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:32.000
What're you going to do about it,
old man?

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.750
Please forgive me!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.580
Wow...

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.540
These guys are using the
oldest trick in the book.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.210
I won't hear any more of your lies.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:44.220
I saw you take that bug
out of your pocket.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.180
Huh?! You sure have got nerve!

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.680
That's quite an attitude
for such a pretty face.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.180
You think this is a joke?

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:54.890
Try saying it again.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.060
Hold it!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:57.940
Who the hell are you?

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:02.610
Just a handsome young hero
who's passing by!

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:04.940
That's what I am.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.780
Stay out of this, kid!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.620
You bastard! Get him!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.200
Oh, yeah!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.420
How dare you!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.850
W-we'll let it go this time!

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:36.270
Listen.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:39.440
You won't find many guys more
serious about revenge than us!

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.860
You just remember!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.540
Losers!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:45.900
Where's the girl?

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.950
Are you alright, sir?

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.700
Thanks so much.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.620
If you must thank someone,
thank him.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:52.620
Right?

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.080
Uh, well...

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.410
Mister!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:06:00.830
It's acting up again.
I'll have to close up shop.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:06.880
Here you go!

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.350
Here you are.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.230
Thank you, thank you,
thank you!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.240
What a surprise.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:30.390
Are you taking cooking lessons?

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.700
Well, something like that.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.700
By the way, what is your name?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.000
Oh... I'm Sai Sai...

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.790
...I mean...

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.250
...Chin Chikurin.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.050
"Chikurin"?

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.510
That's an unusual name.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.470
The foghorn's calling out to me.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.740
Well, I must get going now.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.270
I go this way.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.560
Good night.

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:09.400
Good...

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.490
...night...

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.500
Hey, Chikurin!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:24.420
Y-yes, yeah?!

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:28.130
That shop owner won't
be on his feet for some time!

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:31.510
And I'd love to taste some more
of your cooking!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.180
Does she mean...?

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.970
So, I'll see you tomorrow!

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:38.970
Yeah! Tomorrow!

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.690
I'll be there! That's a promise!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.940
All right. All right.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.780
All right!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:54.740
I'm back!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.120
You're awfully late.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.240
Hey, Hans.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:02.120
I made friends with someone
really fun today.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.670
Huh? A guy?

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.170
Well, yeah.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.130
What kind of guy?

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.670
I'm not telling.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.570
Sai Saici.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.570
Where's he disappeared to?

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.830
He's hardly trained
these past few days.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.200
Followers of the Shaolin Temple
will be here to cheer him on.

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:45.290
Hurray!

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.050
What is the matter with that boy?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:27.750
Really?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:32.090
So, you're tagging along with your
brother who's here on business?

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.590
I travel with him because
our parents are gone.

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.260
Same here.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:36.760
Huh?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.390
My parents passed away, too.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:44.140
So now I live with these grandpas
who raised me.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.340
"Grandpas"?

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.770
Well, they're not my real grandpas.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:52.230
And I hate the way they always
treat me like a child.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:57.280
But it's nice to have people
who care about you close by.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.950
I don't have any friends here.

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:03.080
So sometimes I get really lonely.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.450
But you've got me.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.080
Huh?

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:07.620
Well, uh...

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:11.750
...only if it's okay with you,
Cecile, I, uh...

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.460
Thanks.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.050
Hey, will you look at that?

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:22.300
When did that happen?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.760
Let's go over and say hi.

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:25.890
Stop it.

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:28.520
Show some consideration!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.640
You think?

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.440
Fried rice, coming up!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.910
Let's see. The map says it
should be right around here.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:46.790
There she is.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:48.410
Thanks for waiting.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.620
Cecile... Cecile...

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.330
Cecile!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.720
And the next one's
going to be for Cecile.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.420
If I'm not mistaken, you're...

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.010
You're Neo Denmark's...

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.470
And you must be
Dragon Gundam's Fighter.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.970
What are you doing here?

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:07.600
Big brother...

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:08.350
Huh?!

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:22.950
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:25.910
What?

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:27.990
He hasn't arrived yet?

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:29.080
No.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:33.270
I thought he had already
made his way here.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.710
The starting gong will
strike at noon sharp.

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.170
If he's not here in time...

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.840
...we'll lose our first match
by default.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:41.090
Huh?

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:45.050
The followers of the
Shaolin Temple have arrived.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.810
I wonder what happened to him.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:50.220
That young girl was...

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.230
Hey there!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.360
You're Sai Saici's friend, right?

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.690
Would you mind if I
asked you something?

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:57.690
Huh?

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.780
Listen, Cecile.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.780
This guy is Sai Saici
of Neo China.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.370
He's my opponent in
tomorrow's match.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.200
Come on.
You're kidding, right?

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.620
Isn't that right, Chikurin?

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:14.960
Is it true?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.630
Tell me it's not true.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:20.710
Please!

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:23.970
Chikurin!

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:29.430
I see.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.100
So, that's what happened.

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.890
Come to think of it...

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.390
...he's grown up.

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:36.730
We've been so preoccupied
with the Fight...

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:37.980
...we failed to see that.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:39.360
Yes, but...

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:41.610
I'll go find him!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:44.700
B-but you're...

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:47.570
I don't think it's right to
leave it like this!

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:48.990
So...

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:50.410
...that's why...

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.870
...I'm going to look for him!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.420
Boy, it's hot!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:04.510
Yeah. How're we supposed
to work in this heat?

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.100
Hey, it's the guy from...

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:14.430
Almost time for the match.

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:16.810
If you know that,
what are you doing here?

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.110
C-Cecile...

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.400
Why aren't you at
the fighting grounds?

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.820
Feeling sorry for us?

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.820
You think it's an easy win, right?

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:32.110
You're feeling sorry for us
because we're going to lose.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.200
That's not the reason.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.620
Then tell me why.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.080
The Mermaid Gundam's
pretty badly damaged, right?

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:43.880
So, if it gets eliminated,
you'd have to go home.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.380
Well, uh...

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:47.630
Then I'll never see you again!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:55.930
My brother's been looking
forward to fighting...

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.640
...against Dragon Gundam.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.480
They say Mermaid Gundam...

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.880
...doesn't stand a chance
against Dragon Gundam.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.280
But I honestly believe that...

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:09.200
...that my brother will win!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.620
Cecile...

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:11.990
Please!

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:13.790
Fight my brother!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.120
Fair and square,
and with all your might!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.080
Hey, you!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.090
Getting all lovey-dovey,
are we?!

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:26.880
If it ain't the little pipsqueak
from the other day!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:30.010
Sorry, but I don't have
time to mess around with you!

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:30.760
Let's go!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.830
Not so fast, twerp!

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:38.810
We'll be sure to pay you back
for what you did the other day.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.350
These guys...

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.690
Hold it!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.570
I'll accept your challenge!

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:49.530
Sai Saici...

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.820
...hurry over to the
fighting grounds.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:53.410
Bro! And Sis, too!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.950
Thanks!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:55.990
- Let's go!
- Right!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.960
Hey!
Where do you think you're going?!

00:14:58.960 --> 00:14:59.960
Shut up!

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.080
Your fight's with me.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.580
Gundam!

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:17.020
Come at me whatever
way you want!

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.180
There's nothing to be scared of.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:21.850
It's only one of him
against three of us.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.860
We'll show him how good
we can fight.

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.150
Yeah!

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:31.650
Jet Scream Crush!

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:34.070
Domon!

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.370
I know.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.910
I only need one foot
to defeat them!

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.760
We won't forget this!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.340
Hurry, Domon.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:55.600
Yeah.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:57.310
I wonder if Sai Saici made it
there in time.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:00.180
<i>Just two minutes before</i>
<i>the start of this match</i>.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:04.650
<i>But the Dragon Gundam</i>
<i>has not yet made an appearance</i>.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:08.780
<i>As it stands, Neo Denmark will</i>
<i>almost certainly win by default</i>.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:09.780
Now, then...

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.740
...members of the Neo China
Shaolin Temple...

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.700
...have come out here
to cheer him on.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.450
Any comment?

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.700
At this rate, the revival of
our Shaolin Temple will be...

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.410
...no more than a dream!

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:27.540
Oh, how distressing, everybody!

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:29.300
Thank you!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.590
Please forgive us.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.050
This is all because of our
own shortcomings.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:38.180
<i>Since the opponent is not here,</i>
<i>this match shall be</i>...

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:40.440
Wait a minute!

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:42.140
He's here!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:43.520
He's here?!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.020
He's here?!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.020
He's here!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.020
He's here!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.730
Yes, he's here!

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:51.730
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.910
Sai Saici!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.620
I sure was surprised finding out
you were her boyfriend.

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.040
So was I.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:07.080
I never would've dreamed that
you were Cecile's older brother.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.670
Just because you're
a friend of my sister's...

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:10.840
...doesn't mean I'll hold back!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.340
Same goes for you!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.800
I prefer it that way!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.010
All right!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.680
Gundam Fight!

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.680
Ready!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.260
Go!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.640
Wh-what incredible energy!

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:30.610
Mermaid Gundam's going to
give everything it's got now!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:41.530
What?!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:52.920
Sai Saici!

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:00.180
I've got the advantage
in the water!

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:01.050
Here I go!

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:17.780
H-he's quick!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:21.450
<i>Now</i>...

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.990
...<i>the battle has switched</i>
<i>from surface to underwater</i>...

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:27.870
...<i>and with no way to retaliate,</i>
<i>Dragon Gundam is on the defensive!</i>

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:32.590
Mermaid Gundam's true strengths
are in underwater battle.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.550
Chikurin... Hans...

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:41.720
Watch!

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:44.060
You will witness Mermaid
Gundam's true strength!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.470
Darn!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.270
I've got you!

00:18:58.180 --> 00:18:59.150
You won't escape!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.370
You're not going to get me!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.330
Wha...?

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:16.670
Wh-where is he?!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.130
Where'd you go?!
Come out!

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.430
Hiding's not going to help you!

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.520
I did it! Cecile!

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.900
I've defeated Dragon Gundam!

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:43.280
Victory is mine!

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.040
All right!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:50.200
I've won the match!

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.000
Just his arm?

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.050
Then that means...

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:11.060
You actually tore your own
arm off to win the match?

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:14.020
I had to because I knew
you were too strong for me.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.520
Then I lose.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:25.990
Dragon Gundam is the
winner of the match!

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.990
Hurray! Hurray! Hurray!

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.620
Sai Saici!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:31.700
You did well!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.780
Sai Saici, way to go.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.170
Hey, Bro.

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:42.920
That was a great Fight.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.310
It really was.

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:58.230
Guess you have to go now.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:01.480
We don't have the
Mermaid Gundam anymore...

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:03.150
...so there's no choice.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:04.070
I'm sorry.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.200
It's all right.

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:08.030
I'm glad you did what I asked
and fought him honestly.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.410
Cecile...

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:10.540
We'd better get going now.

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:14.690
Thanks for everything
you've done for me.

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:18.210
I'll never forget you

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:21.880
Goodbye.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:27.760
Sai Saici!

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:31.970
I'm rooting for you!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.520
Do your best!

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:36.730
Take care of yourself!

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:47.610
Nothing is permanent.

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:49.280
Life is ever-changing.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:52.490
No human can remain
a child forever.

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:57.310
We may be mistaken to
keep treating Sai Saici...

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.880
...as a mere child.

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:06.470
Cecile, I promise...

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:08.890
...I'll win the championship
for sure.

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:10.600
So watch me.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:12.350
Cecile!

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:27.820
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:30.320
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:35.620
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:38.160
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:43.290
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:46.960
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:53.680
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:53.930 --> 00:23:01.230
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:05.780
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:09.360
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:16.830
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:25.670
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:35.300 --> 00:23:37.180
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:39.520
A new rival appears
before Domon.

00:23:39.810 --> 00:23:42.100
Her name is Allenby Beardsley.

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:44.730
This young woman was brought
up to be an invincible Fighter.

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:46.860
She becomes a fierce Berserker...

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:49.240
...during her attack on Domon!

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:52.200
Next on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:56.080
Beautiful Fighter!
Dangerous Allenby

00:23:53.870 --> 00:24:00.000
Beautiful Fighter!
Dangerous Allenby

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:57.910
Ready! Go!
